 days&#10;demo: usage retention&#10;90 days&#10;Retention report unavailable: Requested function was not found&#10;Sweep totals cover every family in the deployment, so the server reports the global marker to the family owner only — it is not shown to this account. Signaling rows are swept after 7 days and audit rows after 365 days; location and usage follow each family’s windows above.&#10;The server decides the scope. A parent export contains the location, usage, alert and audit rows of every family they belong to — including rows recorded about other members — while a child export is limited to their own devices. A copy is saved in this device's app storage and the JSON can be copied to the clipboard.&#10;Deleting requires two confirmations: a warning, then typing DELETE and your account email. Other members’ data is never deleted; an owner with remaining members or active devices is refused." checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,685]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.parentcontrol.parent_control" content-desc="Delete my account" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[87,100][993,231]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.parentcontrol.parent_control" content-desc="Manage retention and audit log" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[87,467][993,599]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.parentcontrol.p